<section class="ah-admin-section delivery-settings" data-delivery-settings hidden aria-labelledby="delivery-settings-heading">
  <div class="ah-admin-section-heading"><div><h2 id="delivery-settings-heading">报名确认与票券</h2><p>审核通过并取得名额后处理正式通知。待审核不寄正式邀请；读取确认页不会重发。</p></div><button type="button" class="ah-admin-button" data-delivery-refresh>重新读取设置</button></div>
  <p class="ah-admin-error" data-delivery-error role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
  <p class="delivery-status" data-delivery-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div class="delivery-pending" data-delivery-pending hidden><p>上次操作结果尚待确认。请保留本页，再次确认同一操作；不会另建发送请求。</p><button class="ah-admin-button" type="button" data-delivery-retry>再次确认同一操作</button></div>
  <div data-delivery-state hidden>
    <div class="delivery-summary"><article><h3>确认邮件</h3><p data-delivery-mail-ready></p></article><article><h3 id="wallet-settings-title">Apple Wallet</h3><p data-delivery-wallet-ready></p><p class="delivery-muted" data-delivery-wallet-expiry hidden></p></article></div>
    <form data-delivery-automatic><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" /> 核准或转正后自动发送正式确认邮件</label><p class="delivery-muted">只处理取得名额的公开申请，不向原始意向名单或工作人员代登记对象自动群发。</p><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button">保存邮件设置</button></form>
    <dl class="delivery-counts" data-delivery-counts></dl>
    <details class="delivery-guide" data-delivery-setup-guide><summary>设置指南</summary><h3>确认邮件</h3><ul data-delivery-mail-missing></ul><ol><li>在 EmailJS 连接寄件账号，建立报名确认模板。</li><li>按指引加入服务、模板与寄件配置。</li><li>状态可用后再开启自动确认信，并核对测试邮箱。</li></ol><a href="https://github.com/kunanli/artdicohost/blob/main/docs/registration-confirmation.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看确认信设置指引</a><h3>Apple Wallet</h3><ul data-delivery-wallet-missing hidden></ul><p class="delivery-muted" data-delivery-wallet-device hidden>设置后仍需用真实 iPhone 验证加入 Wallet。</p><ol><li>完成 Apple Developer 注册，建立活动的 Pass Type ID。</li><li>准备签章证书、私钥、Apple WWDR 与根证书。</li><li>按受控指引验证并上传加密设置包；私钥不填入网页。</li><li>用真实 iPhone 验证后再开放票券。</li></ol><a href="https://github.com/kunanli/artdicohost/blob/main/docs/apple-wallet-setup.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 Wallet 设置与轮替指引</a></details>
    <details class="delivery-guide"><summary>补发所选公开报名的确认邮件</summary><p>选择登记编号后明确执行。服务商接受、明确拒绝及结果不明分别记录；结果不明的邮件不会再次发送。</p><form data-delivery-dispatch><div class="ah-admin-field"><label for="delivery-registration-ids">登记编号（最多 100 人，按行或逗号分隔）</label><textarea id="delivery-registration-ids" name="registrationIds" rows="4" maxlength="5000" required autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"></textarea></div><label><input type="checkbox" name="retryRejected" /> 已核对原因，允许再尝试曾明确未发出的邮件</label><button type="submit" class="ah-admin-button">发送所选确认邮件</button></form><div data-delivery-results></div></details>
  </div>
</section>
